<title>UK: UBS sets call warrants on UBS.</title>
<headline>UBS sets call warrants on UBS.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Union Bank of Switzerland said it</p>
<p>had issued 20 million American-style call warrants on Union Bank</p>
<p>of Switzerland shares.</p>
<p>50 warrants control one share.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    1,175.00 CHF	    PREMIUM	12.50 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE     2.70 CHF		  GEARING	8.60 TIMES</p>
<p> MATURITY DATE   15.JAN.99		 PAYDATE	31.JAN.97</p>
<p> LISTING	   SWISS SE		  MIN EXER LOT 100</p>
<p> SPOT REFERENCE  1,164.00 CHF</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
